OL,3,APanama Canal to cut number of ships
OL,4,Apassing through due to El Nino
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe shipping industry is already
OL,7,Fdealing with severe disruptions due to
OL,8,Fthe Iran war causing a large reduction
OL,9,Fin the number of vessels passing
OL,10,Fthrough the crucial Strait of Hormuz.
